        "Opera Epiclese",
        "Navia's dream",
        "Poisson victims"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Melus",
        "Silver",
        "Navia"
      ],
      "comment": "Melus: The dream-trial in Opera Epiclese",
      "content": "When Navia falls into the Primordial Seawater (Meeting Is Also Parting), she finds herself in Poisson with Melus and Silver, led to the Opera Epiclese where an audience of Fontainians, who are other flood victims, demands she stay. Melus and Silver, in Oceanid form, defend her and tell her not to admit guilt; Neuvillette arrives, dismisses the crowd and urges her to take his hand. Melus makes a last joke and says goodbye.",
