      "key": [
        "Poisson flood",
        "Poisson tremor",
        "Deluge of Wrathful Waters"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Melus",
        "Silver",
        "Navia"
      ],
      "comment": "Melus: The Poisson flood",
      "content": "After a tremor, Primordial Sea water rose in lower Poisson and dissolved everyone it touched. Melus and Silver were helping evacuate residents. Navia told the Traveler that she is the one who started the rescue plan and that she could not hold a funeral for them.\n\nIn a memory Navia recalls visiting Callas's grave with Melus and Silver, when Melus joked that being buried beside Callas would spare Navia a trip, and she said she would make the journey wherever they lay.",
